{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter The Odyssey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/2c1194f623e51f8be033ef4a156e6936.avif?t=1768472900\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the legendary girth of Mauri the Walrus take you on an adventure unlike any other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a colourful cast of silly critters, visit memorable locations and flatten your enemies with true-and-tested Mauri-style! Ready your flippers and sharpen your tusks and be the walrus Helen of Troy dreams of at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/41a36d749d97d6d4a977922a41c631a3.avif?t=1768472900\" width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the true Iliad! Embark on a journey of epic proportions! Test your mettle and fulfil your destiny as Mauri the Walrus faces a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the wind in your blubber as you travel from island to island and spit Death in the eye socket for even looking at you funny. Do you possess the cardinal virtues of a hero and the strength of mind to rekindle the fires to light the path for the future?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plenty Of Quest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/cf0da65b8ad51c66e632596c3217e43a.avif?t=1768472900\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Platonic Forms might need some readjusting, because Mauri is the only walrus you need in your head.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3207480?t=1768472900","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/e0214a52d430f9edfed30e5a789f5dfbcdaefff5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768472900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/b626ae8bdb70b8359c574a144c6435baeeefc6ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768472900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/b626ae8bdb70b8359c574a144c6435baeeefc6ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768472900","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter The Odyssey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/2c1194f623e51f8be033ef4a156e6936.avif?t=1768472900\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the legendary girth of Mauri the Walrus take you on an adventure unlike any other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a colourful cast of silly critters, visit memorable locations and flatten your enemies with true-and-tested Mauri-style! Ready your flippers and sharpen your tusks and be the walrus Helen of Troy dreams of at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207480/extras/41a36d749d97d6d4a977922a41c631a3.avif?t=1768472900\" width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_